{"step_index":545,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:11:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T17:11:25+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T17:11:25+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/.ansible/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/pdns-auth-hook.sh`\nTotal Lines: 38\nTotal Bytes: 1553\nShowing lines 1 to 38\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: #!/usr/bin/env bash\n2: # Hook d'authentification DNS-01 pour certbot --manual — backend PowerDNS (dnsp-mst).\n3: #\n4: # Certbot appelle ce script avec CERTBOT_DOMAIN et CERTBOT_VALIDATION dans\n5: # l'environnement. PDNS_API_URL, PDNS_API_KEY et PDNS_DNS_HOST doivent être\n6: # fournis dans l'environnement par la tâche Ansible qui invoque certbot\n7: # (jamais écrits en dur dans ce fichier ni dans un fichier de credentials).\n8: set -euo pipefail\n9: \n10: : \"${PDNS_API_URL:?PDNS_API_URL non défini}\"\n11: : \"${PDNS_API_KEY:?PDNS_API_KEY non défini}\"\n12: : \"${PDNS_DNS_HOST:?PDNS_DNS_HOST non défini}\"\n13: : \"${CERTBOT_DOMAIN:?CERTBOT_DOMAIN non défini}\"\n14: : \"${CERTBOT_VALIDATION:?CERTBOT_VALIDATION non défini}\"\n15: \n16: record_name=\"_acme-challenge.${CERTBOT_DOMAIN}.\"\n17: zone=\"${CERTBOT_DOMAIN}.\"\n18: \n19: curl -sf -X PATCH \\\n20:   -H \"X-API-Key: ${PDNS_API_KEY}\" \\\n21:   -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n22:   \"${PDNS_API_URL}/servers/localhost/zones/${zone}\" \\\n23:   -d \"{\\\"rrsets\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"${record_name}\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"TXT\\\",\\\"ttl\\\":60,\\\"changetype\\\":\\\"REPLACE\\\",\\\"records\\\":[{\\\"content\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"${CERTBOT_VALIDATION}\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"disabled\\\":false}]}]}\" \\\n24:   >/dev/null\n25: \n26: # Attendre la propagation en interrogeant directement le serveur autoritaire\n27: # (pas un résolveur public, qui pourrait mettre en cache une réponse négative).\n28: for _ in $(seq 1 30); do\n29:   found=\"$(dig +short TXT \"${record_name}\" @\"${PDNS_DNS_HOST}\" | tr -d '\"')\"\n30:   if [ \"${found}\" = \"${CERTBOT_VALIDATION}\" ]; then\n31:     exit 0\n32:   fi\n33:   sleep 2\n34: done\n35: \n36: echo \"Timeout en attendant la propagation du TXT ${record_name} sur ${PDNS_DNS_HOST}\" >&2\n37: exit 1\n38: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":546,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:11:25Z","thinking":"**Identifying Incorrect Zone Configuration**\n\nThe script sets `zone` to `${CERTBOT_DOMAIN}.`, which appears incorrect. Analyzing the provided example, where `CERTBOT_DOMAIN` is `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`, the PowerDNS zone is actually `outremer-telecom.fr.`. This mismatch will cause PowerDNS to report a 404 error because the specified zone does not exist.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"/home/koby/infra-management-system/playbooks/issue-le-cert.yml","EndLine":300,"StartLine":230,"toolAction":"Viewing pdns_api_key retrieval in issue-le-cert.yml","toolSummary":"View pdns_api_key retrieval"}}]}
{"step_index":547,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:11:29Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T17:11:29+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T17:11:29+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/playbooks/issue-le-cert.yml`\nTotal Lines: 663\nTotal Bytes: 37471\nShowing lines 230 to 300\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n230:     le_ca_bundle: /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt\n231:     # ── Versement automatique du bundle dans GitLab (API REST v4) ─────────────\n232:     # Supprime le copier-coller manuel des blocs base64 depuis les logs Semaphore\n233:     # (source d'erreurs de transcription : constaté le 06/08/2026 sur\n234:     # stats.sfrcaraibe.com, 2 tentatives corrompues sur la clé privée).\n235:     # Le clone git du runner est en lecture seule, mais un PAT est un canal\n236:     # INDÉPENDANT de ce clone — même principe que playbooks/generate-idemia-csr.yml.\n237:     # Mettre à false pour revenir au flux manuel (affichage base64 + instructions).\n238:     le_commit_to_gitlab: true\n239:     le_gitlab_url: \"https://gitsi.intranet.local\"\n240:     le_gitlab_project_id: \"144\"\n241:     # Branche CIBLE. Le playbook n'y pousse jamais en direct : `main` est protégée\n242:     # (push_access_levels = « No one », relevé le 06/08/2026), donc le bundle passe\n243:     # par une branche de travail le-cert/<fqdn>-<horodatage> + une MR mergée par API\n244:     # — la seule voie qui aboutisse, et elle respecte la protection.\n245:     le_gitlab_branch: main\n246:     # false = la MR est ouverte mais laissée à merger à la main (revue humaine).\n247:     le_gitlab_auto_merge: true\n248:     # Le runner clone déjà gitsi en HTTPS : la CA interne est dans son magasin système,\n249:     # et ansible.builtin.uri