{"step_index":549,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:11:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T17:11:31+04:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-10T17:11:31+04:00\nFile Path: `file:///home/koby/infra-management-system/playbooks/issue-le-cert.yml`\nTotal Lines: 663\nTotal Bytes: 37471\nShowing lines 300 to 320\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n300:       ansible.builtin.include_vars:\n301:         file: \"{{ playbook_dir }}/../scripts/acme/pdns_api_vault.yml\"\n302:       no_log: true\n303: \n304:     - name: >-\n305:         Diagnostic — lire un éventuel log certbot laissé par une exécution\n306:         précédente dans ce même workspace (Semaphore réutilise le répertoire\n307:         par template) ; purement informatif, ne bloque jamais le run\n308:       ansible.builtin.slurp:\n309:         src: \"{{ le_certbot_state_dir }}/logs/letsencrypt.log\"\n310:       register: _le_prev_log\n311:       failed_when: false\n312: \n313:     - name: Afficher les 60 dernières lignes du log précédent (clé API masquée)\n314:       ansible.builtin.debug:\n315:         msg: >-\n316:           {{ (_le_prev_log.content | b64decode).split('\\n')[-60:]\n317:              | map('replace', pdns_api_key, '***REDACTED***') | list }}\n318:       when: _le_prev_log.content is defined\n319: \n320:     - name: Vérifier la présence du bundle CA système (le_ca_bundle)\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
